        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-88" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;A.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;The cron job has to sum up the views count for each of the videos over the last month period.&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;For each video, there will be 30 days * 24 hours = 720 data points that need to be summed up&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;At the scale of 4 billion videos, that&#39;s like doing computation for 4 Billion * 720 Data points (HUGE!!)&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="134" width="552" x="-1162" y="5240" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-89" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="&lt;div&gt;B. Once the data is aggregated as in the below format, sort the videos to find the top K:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
