        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-131" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Option 3:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="60" x="-1231.5" y="6939" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-132" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Have Flink job do the aggregation at hourly, weekly, monthly granularity etc&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;It will eliminate the need for Postgres and cron job completely&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Flink job can write data aggregated hourly, daily and monthly data to Redis cache&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="456" x="-1225.5" y="7014" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-133" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Disadvantages of this solution (why it&#39;s not good for interviews):&amp;nbsp;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="461" x="-1259" y="7100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-135" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="1. It makes the entire problem lean heavily on Flink, which the interviewer might not be happy with." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="576" x="-1244.5" y="7166" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-136" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="2. The interview discussion might shift to Flink internals, algorithms etc which we might not be familiar with" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="576" x="-1231.5" y="7220" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-137" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="(This is required for first functional requirement to query top K videos from all time)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="267" x="-349" y="6771" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2RgB2zIPSqEstAvz9yk-138" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" value="Updated HLD diagram with Flink doing the aggregation and sorting:" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="30" width="313.5" x="-1277.75" y="7314" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
